<p dir="auto">Installs the native Rust binary:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="npm install -g agent-browser
agent-browser install  # Download Chrome from Chrome for Testing (first time only)"><pre>npm install -g agent-browser
agent-browser install  <span class="pl-c"><span class="pl-c">#</span> Download Chrome from Chrome for Testing (first time only)</span></pre></div>
<div class="markdown-heading" dir="auto"><h3 tabindex="-1" class="heading-element" dir="auto">Project Installation (local dependency)</h3><a id="user-content-project-installation-local-dependency" class="anchor" aria-label="Permalink: Project Installation (local dependency)" href="#project-installation-local-dependency"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"></path></svg></a></div>
<p dir="auto">For projects that want to pin the version in <code>package.json</code>:</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="npm install agent-browser
agent-browser install"><pre>npm install agent-browser
agent-browser install</pre></div>
<p dir="auto">Then use via <code>package.json</code> scripts or by invoking <code>agent-browser</code> directly.</p>
