agent-browser is checked &lt;sel&gt;        # Check if checked"><pre>agent-browser is visible <span class="pl-k">&lt;</span>sel<span class="pl-k">&gt;</span>        <span class="pl-c"><span class="pl-c">#</span> Check if visible</span>
